    <us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock contextRef="From2012-04-01to2012-06-30">&lt;p style="margin: 0pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;4. &amp;#9;EQUITY&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;Diluted EPS (Earnings per Share) gives effect&#13;to all dilutive potential common shares outstanding during the period. The computation of Diluted EPS does not assume conversion,&#13;exercise or contingent exercise of securities that would have an anti-dilutive effect on losses. As a result, if there is a loss&#13;from continuing operations, Diluted EPS is computed in the same manner as Basic EPS. At June 30, 2012 and 2011, the Company had&#13;1,245,000 options outstanding, that were not included in the calculation of earnings per share for the periods then ended. Such&#13;financial instruments may become dilutive and would then need to be included in future calculations of Diluted EPS. At June 30,&#13;2012 and 2011, the outstanding options were considered anti-dilutive since the strike prices were above the market price and since&#13;the Company has incurred losses year to date.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;On August 24, 2011, Albert E. Whitehead, the&#13;Company&amp;#146;s Chief Executive Officer, was issued 2,000,000 shares of the Company&amp;#146;s common stock for a purchase price of&#13;$.05 per share for a total investment of $100,000.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"&gt;On May 31, 2012, at an Annual Meeting of Stockholders,&#13;the stockholders approved an increase of the Company&amp;#146;s authorized shares of common stock by 50,000,000 to 150,000,000.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#13;&#13;&#13;&lt;p style="margin: 0pt"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock>
